      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could this be simplified?\n\n```\n{\n  std::lock_guard\u003cstd::mutex\u003e lock(dumpsys_guard_);\n  const auto connect_list \u003d (le_impl_ !\u003d nullptr) ? le_impl_-\u003econnect_list : std::unordered_set\u003cAddressWithType\u003e();\n  const auto le_connectability_state \u003d (le_impl_ !\u003d nullptr) ? (int)le_impl_-\u003econnectability_state_ : 0;\n  const auto le_create_connection_timeout_alarms_count \u003d\n      (le_impl_ !\u003d nullptr) ? (int)le_impl_-\u003ecreate_connection_timeout_alarms_.size() : 0;\n}\n```\n\nWhen lock goes out of scope it will automatically unlock",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 337,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 343,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "d7c043b2960d40c6b4837b11e6886f909cdbe958",
